@TutorMatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

### Register a new student
POST {{TutorMatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@tutormatch.ro",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Student Test",
  "role": "Student"
}

### Login with email and password
POST {{TutorMatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@tutormatch.ro",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Google OAuth Login / Registration
POST {{TutorMatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "<GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN>",
  "role": "Student"
}

### Get current user info (requires Bearer token)
GET {{TutorMatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
